   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Documentary on Mekong Dam Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna dokument&#xe4;r, som ocks&#xe5; finansieras av IUCN och CPWF, kommer att  belysa kopplingarna mellan dammbyggande, m&#xe4;nniskorna som ber&#xf6;rs,      deras utkomst och milj&#xf6;n i Mekong-regionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This film, which is also supported by IUCN and CPWF, will take an     in-depth look at the linkages between dams, people, livelihoods and   the environment in the Greater Mekong Sub-Region.</narrative>
  </description>
